      "content": "Functional endpoints for automating customer interactions with Rasgo data-warehouse metadata. Available to Rasgo customers on Enterprise plans and above. The API is in beta; Rasgo reserves the right to change endpoint names and contracts.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Rasgo",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
}